OL,3,GNEWSAMan says growing vegetables as big
OL,4,Aas babies is like a sport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who grows vegetables that are
OL,7,Ftaller than children and as heavy as
OL,8,Fbabies has said his hobby is "like a
OL,9,Fsport".
OL,11,FAniket Sardana, a veterinary surgeon
OL,12,Fwho lives in Bristol, said he became
OL,13,F"fascinated" by gardening when he was
OL,14,Fseven and opted to buy seed packets
OL,15,Finstead of sweets during his childhood.
OL,17,FA meeting with a world record-breaking
OL,18,Fgiant vegetable grower in 2020 inspired
OL,19,Fhim to start growing colossal crops,
OL,20,Fincluding a 1.46m (4.79ft) carrot, a
OL,21,F1.38kg (3.04lb) aubergine and a 65.8cm
OL,22,F(25.9in) cucumber.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
